rule HouseholdAccessIsAsymmetric
	statement: Household access is resource-specific. A spouse's view grant does not allow transactions, mandate changes or access changes; a minor has no inferred access; a dependent parent sees the care schedule only. Private messages, accounts and transactions stay outside spouse and dependant grants unless explicitly added.
	lineageTag: 3a946fd3-56da-503c-b289-3d105958f5cf

	ruleReferencedEntity HouseholdAccessGrant
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty Permissions

		ruleReferencedProperty DeniedPermissions

	ruleReferencedEntity HouseholdMember
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty RelationToOwner

		ruleReferencedProperty AgeBand

	ruleReferencedRelationship 'Access Grant For Household Member'
